# The Docker build context is the workspace root (docker/multinode/Dockerfile).
# Only what `cargo build` reads belongs in it: build output, worktrees, VCS
# metadata and mutation debris would only slow every context transfer and
# invalidate the source layer for nothing.
target/
**/target/
.claude/
.git/
mutants.out/
**/mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/
**/mutants.out.old/
scratch/
gen/
# The harness's own files: editing a compose file or a fixture must not
# rebuild the binaries.
docker/
!docker/multinode/horde-node
